   - "What are the trade-offs between using higher transmit power and larger antennas in GEO ground terminals, and how can we balance these factors in the design?"

   **Response:**
   - Using higher transmit power and larger antennas in GEO ground terminals can improve link quality and reduce path loss, but this comes at the cost of increased power consumption and physical footprint. To balance these factors, we can optimize the transmit power and antenna size based on the specific requirements of the application.
