1. **Predictive Analytics**:
   - **Traffic Pattern Prediction**: AI and ML models can analyze historical traffic data to predict future traffic patterns. This predictive capability helps in proactively adjusting beam configurations to meet upcoming demands.
   - **Real-Time Monitoring and Adjustment**: ML models can continuously monitor network conditions and adjust beam configurations in real-time to ensure optimal resource allocation and minimize latency.

